Subject: [PATCH 76/77] =?UTF-8?q?Meridian:=20=E2=8C=98T=20with=20the=20key?=
 =?UTF-8?q?board=20only,=20like=20Arc?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The field gets the keys from a focused page (an embedded tab loses the
page focus when its element blurs, crbug.com/508638062), and the page
gets them back on close; Esc reaches the bar while a tab loads. The arrows
go through one list, the suggestions and then the matching tabs (just the
tabs with nothing typed, no zero-suggest taking the selection), and stop
autocomplete so the rows hold still.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
